{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id16239435"}, "name":{"label":"Hofmiller"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-14T13:57:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.93.0"}, "id":{"label":"14428199423"}, "title":{"label":"Attention is scarce"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t give notifications rights to many apps, otherwise you get interrupted all day. \n\nDuring onboarding the app proposed to buy the premium option, I refused. Post onboarding you get a full screen popup asking you to buy the premium option you just rejected … I refused again. \nI gave the right to send me notifications to have reminders to drink water (the core value prop of the app, right?).\n20 minutes after I received a pop-up notification on my watch to … buy the premium option. \n\nBefore the app remind me even a single time to drink (you know … what it’s supposed to do), it already interrupted me 3 times to try to upsell me the premium option.\nI’m going to back to simple reminders, at least those don’t overuse my attention", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
