{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1836299550"}, "name":{"label":"Read if you have kids 10-14"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-11T18:28:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.93.0"}, "id":{"label":"14416769554"}, "title":{"label":"Helped me drink more water and changed how I viewed hydration!!🦙"}, "content":{"label":"There are so many amazing things about this app!!! I used to forget to drink water and would get super dehydrated. Water llama gave me tips and tricks and now I and staying hydrated and healthy!\n     I loved the cute design of the app making it amazing for ALL AGES!  Although I am a kid and when I put in my height and weight it  seemed like the prescribed amount of water I was supposed to drink for my goal was meant for an adult, so if yall could make an age range question for the quiz that might help (no I’m not an expert it’s just a suggestion!)also I do know that drinking too much water at once isn’t necessarily good so maybe checkpoints would be helpful! : I had an idea that with each check point you could get an inhale sticker that you could collect in a sticker book! \n     This I do have one small thing though… i wish that you could get more out of the free version of the app\n      Overall a beautiful app and THANK YOU FOR HELPING ME WITH HYDRATION!!!🎈🎈🎈🎈🦆🦆🦆🦙🦙🦙🦙🦙🦙🦙🥳🥳🥳🫪🫪❤️❤️❤️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
